Package: debscp
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, openssh-client, python3-boto3, python3-defusedxml, python3-keyring, python3-paramiko, python3-requests, python3-scp, python3-tk
Description: native Linux multi-protocol file transfer client
 DebSCP provides saved non-secret session profiles, strict SSH host-key
 verification, SFTP, SCP, FTP/FTPS, WebDAV and S3 backends, synchronization,
 queued transfers, workspaces, a desktop GUI, CLI, and Python automation API.
